        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071562",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, through a network of satellites, we offer data-as-a-service products to customers, including synthetic-aperture radar imaging, and through combining our satellite platform with our quantum sensing products, we intend to offer advanced quantum positioning, navigation and timing services in the future.",
        "start_character": 1970,
        "end_character": 2285
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071562-d2465455d1035b79",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071562",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To this end, we now offer a variety of quantum networking, quantum sensing and quantum security products and services that not only enable customers who already use our quantum computing products to deepen their exposure to quantum solutions, but also permit us to commercialize with customers looking to explore a more expansive quantum platform.",
        "start_character": 49229,
        "end_character": 49576
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071562-d2465455d1035b79",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071562",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Today, we sell specialized quantum computing hardware, together with complementary products and services, such as quantum networking, quantum sensing and quantum security products and associated maintenance and support.",
        "start_character": 876,
        "end_character": 1095
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071562-d2465455d1035b79",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071562",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are developing quantum computers designed to solve some of the world’s most complex problems and transform business, society and the planet for the better.",
        "start_character": 470,
        "end_character": 628
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071562-d2465455d1035b79",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071562",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that by offering direct access to quantum computing, supplemented by our professional services, we can assist select customers in deepening their application of quantum solutions.",
        "start_character": 9461,
        "end_character": 9651
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071562-d2465455d1035b79",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071562",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect our standard offerings will include additional bundled value-add services in exchange for an annual commitment, such as reserved system time, consultations with solution scientists, and other application and integration support.",
        "start_character": 50666,
        "end_character": 50904
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071562-d2465455d1035b79",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071562",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have recently begun to do this, by developing and acquiring quantum networking, quantum sensing and quantum security products and services to complement our quantum computers and, if they are commercialized, those of our competitors.",
        "start_character": 10694,
        "end_character": 10930
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071562-d2465455d1035b79",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071562",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manufacture, own and operate quantum systems, with compute units being sold to customers through system hardware sales and on a QCaaS basis, and with an expanding platform of networking, sensing, security and infrastructure units being offered through hardware sales and as service offerings.",
        "start_character": 42975,
        "end_character": 43270
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071562-d2465455d1035b79",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071562",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We may choose to sell these hardware and services to customers in a variety of ways.",
        "start_character": 44029,
        "end_character": 44113
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071562-d2465455d1035b79",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071562",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell quantum hardware, and provide quantum computing services, complemented by access to quantum experts and algorithm development capabilities, designed to solve some of the most challenging issues facing corporations, governments and other large-scale entities today.",
        "start_character": 42702,
        "end_character": 42974
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071562-d2465455d1035b79",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071562",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We supplement our offerings with professional services focused on assisting our customers in applying quantum computing and our quantum networking, quantum sensing and quantum security solutions to their businesses.",
        "start_character": 1658,
        "end_character": 1873
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-071562",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-071562-d2465455d1035b79",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-071562",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Application Phase: This second phase is expected to commence if we are successful in demonstrating the commercial viability of quantum advantage in the industry and can therefore commence with developing commercial applications and applying that advantage broadly throughout the market with new customers.",
